  "abstract": "Proposes a pre-registered test for directional lensing residuals at cluster merger shock fronts. The A_sig estimator measures locally-normalized directional kappa-residual excess to distinguish EFC c_eff(S) predictions from standard GR. Mock validation on synthetic Bullet Cluster analogues shows correct sign separation between models.",
